WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
Silent Chromium touch emulation at 390 by 844.
Playback changes the current word.

00:03.800 --> 00:04.300
An ordinary tap seeks without creating a loop.

00:04.300 --> 00:04.900
An early drag is ignored before the hold threshold.

00:04.900 --> 00:05.500
A deliberate 550 millisecond hold arms selection.

00:05.500 --> 00:06.500
The following drag marks a loop region.

00:06.500 --> 00:15.350
The playhead reaches the selected end and returns to the start.
The phrase repeats twice.

00:15.350 --> 00:15.700
Clear removes the region.

00:15.700 --> 00:16.150
Zoom changes the waveform scale.

00:16.150 --> 00:17.880
The settings drawer switches reading views.
This is browser emulation, not a physical device capture.
